Date: Fri, 7 Aug 2026 19:15:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] video: attach-budget instrumentation (diagnose first,
 counters only)

VIDEO_STATS counts per-participant srcObject assignments, <video>
creations, re-parents, and disagreement-sweep runs; exported via __lc.
60s simulated episode (~20 roster updates + poll cycles), UNFIXED code:

  u_a..u_e, u_host: assignments=1 creations=1 re-parents=0 each
  sweep runs: 82 in 60s (every reflow call, not roster changes)
  dangling after churn: VIDEO_TILES[sid-2] (u_a, passed but still in
  call) - entry survives the sweep holding a live srcObject

The attach path is already idempotent for an unchanged stream; the leak
is the sweep/eviction teardown and its trigger cadence.

